===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[two]]-[[bagger]]}}

# {{lb|en|baseball|slang}} A [[double]] (a two-base hit).
#: ''Jones got a '''two-bagger''' in the first.''
# {{lb|en|running|slang}} A two-miler when running miles for conditioning.
#: ''Zach'' ''got a '''two-bagger''' in yesterday after work. Felt great to relieve stress before going home.''
# {{lb|en|slang|pejorative}} An extremely unattractive person (usually female), the insinuation being that one bag covering her face would not be adequate, but her partner would need to wear one too.
#: {{syn|en|double-bagger}}

